  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of NoobNotFound.WinUI.MessageKit\n\t\t\t- Modern WinUI 3 message dialogs with enhanced customization\n\t\t\t- Support for custom buttons, icons, sounds, and themes\n\t\t\t- Timeout functionality with auto-dismiss\n\t\t\t- Queue management to prevent dialog conflicts\n\t\t\t- Localization support\n\t\t\t- Fluent API for easy configuration\n\t\t\t- Rich response metadata and error handling",
